sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant H as web_ui.html
    participant B as web_ui_bindings.js
    participant F as web_ui_functions.js
    participant S as web_ui_state.js
    participant C as Browser Cookie (opamp_ui_prefs)
    participant A as Provider API

    U->>H: Open Server Console
    H->>B: Load JS modules
    B->>F: init()
    F->>C: read cookie (UI prefs)
    C-->>F: columnOrder + visibleColumns + filtersCollapsed
    F->>S: apply defaults + cookie overrides
    F->>F: write filter/column controls to DOM
    F->>F: render dynamic table header
    F->>A: GET /api/clients (with active filters)
    A-->>F: client list + totals
    F->>H: render table rows using visible ordered columns

    U->>H: Toggle optional column (e.g. Host Name)
    H->>B: change event
    B->>F: applyOptionalColumnSelection()
    F->>S: update visibleColumns
    F->>C: persist prefs cookie
    F->>H: re-render header + table

    U->>H: Drag column header to new position
    H->>B: drag/drop events
    B->>F: moveColumnRelativeToTarget()
    F->>S: update columnOrder
    F->>C: persist prefs cookie
    F->>H: re-render header + table

    U->>H: Toggle filters panel (collapsed/expanded)
    H->>B: click event
    B->>F: toggleFiltersPanel()
    F->>S: update filters.collapsed
    F->>C: persist prefs cookie

    U->>H: Return in later session
    B->>F: init()
    F->>C: read cookie again
    C-->>F: restored personalization
    F->>H: apply same columns/order/panel state
